# Gate step 1235-rfub — data, not code (order 1072-b7eq).
#
# WHAT IT GUARDS. The relay gate compiles the cfg-gated macOS tray as STUBS and
# cannot lint it (measured on lenovinha 2026-09-28: a Linux clippy for
# aarch64-apple-darwin dies in ring's build script), so a relayed
# useless_format reddened trunk for every Mac (d44909353). A change to a gated
# crate now needs a Native-Lint attestation from scripts/attest-native-lint.sh
# bound to the crate's content; land-on-platform-branch.sh refuses without it.
# The fixture drives both scripts over scratch repos with a stub cargo.
#
# STEP_SCRIPT is a LITERAL path on purpose (1063-nraf).
STEP_DESC="Checking a cfg-gated platform crate cannot relay without a native-lint attestation (1235-rfub)"
STEP_SCRIPT="scripts/test-native-lint-attested.sh"
STEP_ERROR="a change to a cfg-gated platform crate can again reach trunk with no host having linted it natively (1235-rfub); see which arm failed above"
STEP_OK="cfg-gated crates relay only with a content-bound native-lint attestation"
